ros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Pallas%27s%20sword%20made%20a,severed%20the%20minotaur%27s%20head.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e11","summary":"The surviving minotaurs scatter after their leader falls.","participants":["minotaurs","pallas","leandros"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"minor","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":22,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":110,"quote":"they had seen their leader fall, and they were scattering.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=they%20had%20seen%20their,and%20they%20were%20scattering.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=they%20had%20seen%20their,and%20they%20were%20scattering.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e13","summary":"Diocles realizes the minotaurs lured and trapped the squad deliberately and says Akros must be warned.","participants":["diocles","minotaurs"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":22,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":123,"quote":"The minotaurs are hunting the Alamon, deliberately.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=The%20minotaurs%20are%20hunting%20the%20Alamon%2C%20deliberately.","citation":{"sourc